description: Restore the mid-beat save through the platform engine; the
  thread continues from the held cursor and serves the same line as the
  uninterrupted run - thread state rides the save.
  Run after p10-save.transcript (it writes the save file).

---

$restore p10-mid-beat

# The restored thread serves exactly what the live run served.
> continue
[OK: contains "By Michaelmas the drawer was bare."]

> go on
[OK: contains "And the master's seal was on every receipt."]

> and?
[OK: contains "So now you know where the money went."]
